// Page Page1 Text :
"P2321174461" "You're the one Colleague talked about, aren't you?"
// Answer Text :
"P2296590417" "What's it to you?"
// Answer Text :
"P8620006" "Yes, that's me."
// Page 1 Text :
"P612471260" "I need you to assure me that none of this is getting back to me. I can’t leave Arachnos just yet. If you can do that, then I can get you the proper codes to get you straight to the leader of this whole project."
// Answer Text :
"P3711966504" "I'll make sure they don't track anything back to you"
// Answer Text :
"P968027664" "I make no guarantees"
// Page 2 Text :
"P1326074488" "Good, good. You're looking for Dr. Hyperbaric. He's in charge of this whole operation. Once you take him down, I should be promoted to his position. You have to understand that I can't help you any further if they trace undoing back to me, right?"
// Answer Text :
"P3026967222" "Yes, nothing will come back to you!"
// Answer Text :
"P3496016942" "That seems like a stretch. Arachnos has a lot of brilliant minds in it."
// Page Friendly Text :
"P1495266452" "Excellent. Here's the passcode for this base. Everyone here will assume that you're supposed to be here... Until you start a fight anyway!"
// Page Hostile Text :
"P246274600" "Without a guarantee, then I will not help you. You'll have to take out Dr. Hyperbaric all on your own!"

