// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - SecondMeasureStart 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Page1 Text :
"P1404929765" "Way I see it, we can do this one of two ways. Fun way or the Boring way?"
// Answer Text :
"P11395981" "Boring way."
// Answer Text :
"P1880153026" "Fun way."
// Page 1 Text :
"P1704192948" "Sigh, boring way eh? Alright. I'll radio ahead and give the Tsoo a description of you and put you on the guest list. You won't have an issue getting past them. When you get to Rising Vengeance, tell him I've offered to help out his hit. Get him to tell you who the target is."
// Answer Text :
"P3848043375" "You're right, does sound boring. Let's do this the fun way instead."
// Answer Text :
"P3564897327" "Good plan"
// Page 2 Text :
"P1413686298" "All right. You go in and take down all the Tsoo you see, I'll get to Rising Vengeance's personal effects and figure out who the target is. You just deal with Rising Vengeance when you come across him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - EndBossDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Page1 Text :
"P1248773441" "And who might you be?"
// Answer Text :
"P1922149325" "Second Measure sent me, told me he's been sent to help your current mission."
// Page 2 Text :
"P3950450423" "Measure, eh? He's good, I'd be happy to have his help on this one. Target's name is Fitzhume, some executive. Tell him to meet me at the guy's house out in Nerva."
// Answer Text :
"P3978486343" "I am afraid that's not how this is going to go down."
// Page 3 Text :
"P3167666811" "What??!"
// Answer Text :
"P165037225" "Fight!"

