"P1970080747" "Great work. Based on the info you and Second Measure gave us, the guy is a bank executive who lives in Nerva named Fitzhume. We’re sending operatives to Fitzhume's house to ensure his security right away. I hope everything went cleanly?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NetworkStart 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Page1 Text :
"P1154169156" "Target known as Mute is somewhere in this facility. Now I am willing to help you, but I need a favor in return."
// Answer Text :
"P558558039" "Favor? We're all on the same team here!"
// Answer Text :
"P4229584463" "Favor. Right, whatever you need, Network."
// Page 1 Text :
"P2021027132" "At the end of the day, I'm on only one team: Team Network. The Hammers is a good payday, but I am thinking it can be better.<br><br>I'm not going in so I am not getting the hazard pay you are, but if you let the bosses know that I -was- in trouble, then we can both profit nicely from this op."
// Answer Text :
"P893733592" "Stuff it, Network. I'll deal with Mute without your help."
// Answer Text :
"P3037182775" "Ok, I'll see about getting you some hazard pay."
// Page 2 Text :
"P863840999" "Listen, that kind of attitude is what made me flip on the Family and join the Hammers to begin with. Don't make me regret my choice."
// Answer Text :
"P2438457618" "I don’t need your help in taking out these mooks. "
// Answer Text :
"P1165026650" "You're right, give me the details and help me out."
// Page Friendly Text :
"P1654793017" "Ok, I've texted all the Family here, and they know to give you a wide berth. Said you were here on behalf of the big boss himself. They should leave you alone until you try to take out Mute anyway. Make sure you hit their computers and get any intel you can."
// Page Hostile Text :
"P2337511777" "You can fight your way to Mute for all I care."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - EndBossDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Page1 Text :
"P3948200349" "You're the one here on the boss' orders, right?"
// Answer Text :
"P3524740101" "Yeah, that's me."
// Answer Text :
"P492285600" "Actually I am here to do some pretty heinous things to you."
// Page 1 Text :
"P2670304624" "So what's the boss want now? I did that last job for him just like he asked."
// Answer Text :
"P2668890525" "He just wanted to make sure that things ended up where they were supposed to."
// Answer Text :
"P3358166803" "What was that job again?"
// Page 2 Text :
"P3032629185" "(Mute shakes his head) Yeah, I put the body in the usual place, just like I always do."
// Answer Text :
"P1472837407" "What place is that?"
// Answer Text :
"P3638648607" "Boss said he didn't get the usual confirmation. Sent me to make sure."
// Page 3 Text :
"P688716765" "<color goldenrod>Mute sighs</color><br><br>How is it MY FAULT that Jake at the junkyard can't make a simple call? I put the body in the trunk, he's the one that crushed it, he should have made the call when it was all done."
// Answer Text :
"P2313175366" "I'll take that to the boss."
// Page Hostile Text :
"P503972672" "Wha-? Intruder!"

