// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3195371605" "Network has the location of one Steve 'Mute' Mutombo. This guy's been arrested more times than any other Family member, and he's never flipped on them. He's done like 12 years in the Zig covering for others, and that earned him his nickname. He was broken out a few months back and is living in the Rogue Isles outside of any extradition. Now we know he probably won't talk so we're not asking you to interrogate him."
// AcceptString :
"P377451312" "What are you asking me to do then?"
// SendOffString :
"P2069606736" "Trick him into giving something up. If that fails, beat him into submission. That's the one method the cops in Paragon never tried."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2570508098" "Mute"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3416996498" "Still here? Go talk to Network"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1002021239" "<color deepskyblue>Mute</color>"

