// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ColleagueStart 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Page1 Text :
"P1662446067" "Good morning, {HeroName}. We need to get a couple things straight before we can begin."
// Answer Text :
"P2618592802" "Just give me the access codes and get out of my way."
// Answer Text :
"P741011759" "What's that, Colleague?"
// Page 2 Text :
"P3441347751" "Sgt. Schorr is short changing me. I swear I am pulling my weight here in the Hammers, and he keeps delaying payments to my account. I shouldn't be paranoid, but I am the one sticking my neck out here."
// Answer Text :
"P1584739560" "I am sure he has good reason. Now, codes please?"
// Answer Text :
"P4241478519" "Hmm, I'll look into this after I take down this operation. What's the situation?"
// Page 3 Text :
"P4194565391" "Hey, we need each other! Don't blow me off. Give me the respect I deserve or you won't get my help!"
// Answer Text :
"P82622763" "You're right, I am sorry. I'll look into this, I promise."
// Answer Text :
"P2947142411" "Whatever, just give me the code."
// Page 4 Text :
"P1516478814" "Good reason? You're just as bad as he is! Why should I even be helping you people?"
// Answer Text :
"P3608499017" "If you don't like it you can go crying back to Positron. Codes. Now."
// Answer Text :
"P1012114929" "Good point. Now let's see you pull your weight and give me the situation and the codes, then we can move past your insecurity."
// Page 5 Text :
"P914277842" "Digiwench has a special nano-assembly robot project to auto repair combat armors like Black Scorpion's. You need to gather up the data she has collected and then put an end to her and her operation."
// Answer Text :
"P1500867271" "OK, thanks. By the way, I am pretty sure I could have figured out all this without your help"
// Answer Text :
"P289656015" "Ok, thanks. By the way, you're doing a great job. Keep it up."
// Page Friendly Text :
"P1340478518" "Here's the passcode: 75751"
// Answer Text :
"P637445866" "Thanks!"
// Page Hostile Text :
"P2799945365" "<color goldenrod> Colleague looks irked. </color><br><br>Here's the passcode: 76761"
// Answer Text :
"P2773622367" "Hmm, that code didn't seem to work."

