"P1167648881" "Defeat Digiwench"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P234087297" "Intruder Alert!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3091146509" "Digiwench"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2766889832" "Are you cleared to be here?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1013718319" "Oh I see how it's gonna be."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P4075366579" "My nanites... will... rebuild."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - GatherClickies 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2806757866" "data files to find"
// SingularDescription :
"P3651841190" "Locate the last data file."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P164761107" "You found data on Black Scorpion's project."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P709513869" "With Digiwench defeated and the data recovered, you can shut down Black Scorpion's project."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4069990700" "Nice job. You and Colleague worked well together I assume?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - SecondMeasureStart 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Page1 Text :
"P782192213" "Hey there, {heroName}. I've had some assignments from this Bronze Talon guy. He's a real piece of work, and not the kind of guy I want to work with anymore. He's here right now though, with his bodyguard."
// Answer Text :
"P4069757533" "Tell me about the bodyguard."
// Answer Text :
"P1050402986" "Let's do this black ops style, no witnesses."
// Page 1 Text :
"P169902673" "He's a thug, but I have a sneaking suspicion that the bodyguard thing might be a ruse. The bodyguard is probably Bronze Talon himself. No bodyguard lasts that long by being as thug-like as that one has been acting. I've alerted the safehouse to your presence, and that you are here on my authority. I'm taking a huge risk here, but you're the one doing all the wet work."
// Page 2 Text :
"P472606811" "You against the world, eh? Sounds good to me. I'm going to see what you're made of, and let them know there's an intruder in their safehouse, put everyone on alert. Good luck.<br><br><color goldenrod>You begin to walk away.</color><br><br>Oh, and one thing. Pretty sure Bronze Talon is a decoy, the real Bronze Talon is the bodyguard. Just an FYI."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - EndBossDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Answer Text :
"P3082644279" "{HeroName}. I'm here to end you."
// Page 1 Text :
"P1251052597" "Figured out my secret, eh? It was only a matter of time. Time to make short work of you, {heroname}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3818036466" "Second Measure has the location of one of the Tsoo's top lieutenants, who goes by the name Bronze Talon. This guy is always with his bodyguard, so it's not going to be an easy hit. Second Measure believes that this is pretty much our best shot at taking him out though."
// AcceptString :
"P4204541339" "Sounds like we don't really have a choice"
// SendOffString :
"P239920695" "Funny thing is, other organizations have put out hits on Talon before, and they have claimed success on occasion, but this guy keeps popping up. Let's not make their mistakes, ok?"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3549488441" "Bronze Armor"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1726707095" "You need to see Second Measure and take out Bronze Talon"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1701564372" "<color deepskyblue>Bronze Armor</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1736899455" "This is the place Second Measure wanted to meet. Bronze Talon and his bodyguard must be here."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - OnEnterObjectiveComplete 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - SetObjectiveText 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - SetObjectiveText 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P2688273784" "Defeat Bronze Talon"
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4177568123" "Bronze Talon"
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYINFO :
"P3735805435" "The 'bodyguard' of Bronze Talon is the actual Bronze Talon himself. You wonder how many decoys this guy has let die to preserve his identity."
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3034397655" "Let me deal with this."
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1091091976" "Feel the vengeance of my ancestors!"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P823915227" "The Decoy"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYINFO :
"P3788260397" "This decoy fits the description that most intelligence organizations have for the Bronze Talon."
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P464398768" "Yes, Mr. Talon."
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P838207900" "I can help you, Bronze Talon. Please, allow me."
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2665197804" "Been ages since I was able to fight someone who knew my secret."
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2314774877" "I can't allow you to live, you know."
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P701972735" "Who clued you in?"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1522014383" "Given time to think, I'd bet that mee-guk-nohm Second Measure figured it out. I am going to have to see him dead once I finish with you."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P551467059" "In death, I curse you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1964501099" "Second Measure was right, the bodyguard was the real Bronze Talon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1929589901" "Second Measure informs me that your work was exemplary. Sorry about the mission parameters changing on you like that, our intel was the same as everyone else's and we assumed that the decoy was Bronze Talon. Glad Second Measure set us straight or we might have let the bodyguard escape our grasp."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NetworkStart 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Page1 Text :
"P2467765226" "Ok, {HeroName}, our target is holed up in here, so it's a simple whack job. But things are never simple in our line of work."
// Answer Text :
"P131650478" "I've noticed"
// Page 1 Text :
"P1202252618" "Somewhere in this safehouse is a safe containing the protection money paid this week. 'Concrete' Bill isn't the sharpest tool in the shed, and from what I can tell he leaves the safe unlocked when he is in the building, since he can never remember the combination. So if you see the safe, do us both a favor and grab that cash. I won't tell Sgt. Schorr if you don't."
// Answer Text :
"P2983455355" "Let's just say I'll consider it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2724600633" "There is a safe here. It is slightly ajar."
// Answer Text :
"P1548504202" "Take some cash for youself, no one will be the wiser."
// Answer Text :
"P2380738002" "Shut the safe like an honest citizen would."
// Page 2 Text :
"P2057293630" "You take some cash."
// Page 3 Text :
"P2410430493" "You shut the safe."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P421130859" "Network wants to see you. He's found the location of one of the Family's enforcers, 'Concrete' Bill. He seemed rather excited to learn his current location and urges you get to him ASAP."
// AcceptString :
"P3704404137" "I wonder why it's so important all of a sudden?"
// SendOffString :
"P3072043490" "I don't know. Concrete is a thug, usually guards the Family's money laundering and protection take. He's tough, but if you can take him out we can get our agents to interrogate him and get him to spill the beans on the rest of the Family's operation here in St. Martial."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P146468918" "Concrete Evidence"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4076543251" "You need to get us 'Concrete' Bill, ASAP, {HeroName}."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2034584546" "<color deepskyblue>Concrete Evidence</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2200381300" "This is the safehouse where Network wanted to meet you."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - SetObjectiveText 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - SetObjectiveText 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P1026411171" "Attend to the safe"
// Script Variable WaypointNames :
"P657013362" "The Safe"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3811208394" "'Concrete' Bill"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1445298762" "Who's there?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2590674834" "Someone is in the mood for some new shoes... I have just the pair for the likes of you."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P2275253406" "Hello there son"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3793214176" "I'm dead!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - DefeatConcrete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2570002245" "Defeat 'Concrete' Bill"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P332581050" "Open Safe"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2325761943" "You dealt with 'Concrete' Bill and the safe, job well done."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1269960654" "Our agents found a safe on the premises, completely emptied out... You didn't have anything to do with that did you? Or did Network go in after you were done and take a little for himself? We expect that kind of behavior from Network, but we hope for better from a member like yourself. I really hope you had nothing to do with this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ColleagueTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1809112495" "Well, looks like we are done here. I want to point out that the primary reason you were so successful in your missions was because of the risks that I took. And you ended up with the largest paycheck, according to Network. Do you think you deserve that? I think I deserve a cut of your pay for the fact that I stuck out my neck to make your job easier."
// Answer Text :
"P685057119" "(Colleague's right, you should give her a cut of your reward.)"
// Answer Text :
"P3703363315" "(Colleague is insane if she thinks she deserves part of YOUR pay.)"
// Page 2 Text :
"P2913876386" "I knew you'd see my side. I think we worked well together, so I'll be keeping the Hammer communicator. If you find yourself in over your head and need a hand, give me a call, ok?"
// Page 3 Text :
"P102916443" "Well I am sorry it had to come to this, but old habits die hard."
// Answer Text :
"P3559911305" "(Colleague grows angry)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - SecondMeasureTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2489989935" "So this is how it's going to go down. You are going to transfer a portion of your pay to my account, and then I will like and respect you a bit more. Or you can keep your cut and learn firsthand what made a guy like me so desired by a group like the Tsoo."
// Answer Text :
"P517968741" "(Give Second Measure a cut of your share)"
// Answer Text :
"P3263850105" "(Steel yourself and tell Second Measure he's not getting a dime more.)"
// Page 2 Text :
"P984964777" "Glad we could come to the understanding. As a measure of my thanks, if you need my help, hit me up on the Hammer communicator. After that I'll consider us even."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NetworkTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P188580003" "I've taken a look at your financials. You don't need the money that the Hammers paid you, so you must have been doing this out of the goodness of your heart. Really did turn over a new leaf did you? I suppose you'll by plying your trade over in Paragon City soon. Now me, on the other hand, I love money, and I can never get enough. So why don't you transfer some of your funds over to my account? Then things don't need to get, um, rough."
// Answer Text :
"P2334336589" "(Give Network a portion of your pay.)"
// Answer Text :
"P1864115350" "(Fight Network to keep your share of the pay)"
// Page 2 Text :
"P341103154" "How very noble of you, {HeroName}, you might make a decent hero yet. Tell you what, you need my help, I'll be there. Just ask for me on the Hammer communicator."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P818221721" "Well, Wyvern feels the Hammers of Justice experiment was a success, but that's just it, it was an experiment. Wyvern's shutting us down and analyzing the results."
// AcceptString :
"P2523839658" "I guess that's it then. This was fun."
// SendOffString :
"P2091903327" "Yeah, the others thought so too, they are in a warehouse nearby and asked you to drop by and say goodbye, have a little 'closing celebration' as it were. I'm going to transfer your reward to your account soon as well, so you've got that to look forward to."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P386333554" "Celebratory Antics"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P65725533" "The other members of the Hammers wanted to talk to you in the warehouse"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3384326840" "<color deepskyblue>Celebratory Antics</color>"

